WEBVTT

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:08.104
This video shows how to create a discount on your phone. Discounts and scholarships reduce what a student pays.

00:00:09.784 --> 00:00:20.632
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Discounts. The page has three tabs: Discounts, Scholarships and Student Assignments.

00:00:23.277 --> 00:00:30.141
On the Discounts tab, tap Add Discount. A form titled Create Discount opens.

00:00:30.995 --> 00:00:40.211
Type the discount name, here Sibling Discount. Choose the type, Percentage or Fixed Amount, and enter the value, here 10.

00:00:42.076 --> 00:00:51.364
In Applies To, choose who gets it, here Siblings. Below, you can set dates and tick Stackable so it can combine with other discounts.

00:00:51.828 --> 00:00:58.956
Tap Create Discount. A message says it was created, and the new discount appears in the list.

00:01:01.858 --> 00:01:10.642
Tap the Scholarships tab. Scholarships are made the same way with Add Scholarship, and you give them to students from Fee Setup.

00:01:11.728 --> 00:01:16.648
The discount is ready. You can now assign it to students.
